The flip is real. packages/ui/src/components/stepper/stepper.tsx:16-17 `/** Controlled current step index. Pair with \`onValueChange\`. */
	value?: number` — the type admits no `null`, so `undefined` is the only clear. :95-99 `const [current = 0, setCurrent] = useControllable<number>({
