}`. So `useNavContext(): CurrentContextValue | undefined` while the exported `NavContextValue` is `CurrentContextValue`: the assignment fails, and a direct property read is a possibly-undefined access. Both are exported as a pair: packages/ui/src/components/nav/index.ts:2 `export { NavContext, type NavContextValue, useNavContext } from './context'`.

